  "id": "network-analysis",
  "term": "network analysis",
  "definition": "Network analysis is a way of studying how symptoms are linked to one another as a network. In mental health research, it is used to examine the pattern of connections among symptoms and to identify which symptoms are the most central within that pattern.",
